<title>UK: Algeria's Skikda oil port reopens - official.</title>
<headline>Algeria's Skikda oil port reopens - official.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria's Skikda oil port reopened on Thursday after a week's closure due to high winds and heavy swell, a port official told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;The port is working since this morning,&quot; he said. &quot;The weather forecast is improving.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Tom Ashby, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8145</p>
</text>
